WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.982 --> 00:00:09.434
This is the home page: today's lessons and reminders.

2
00:00:09.434 --> 00:00:12.725
The menu also has a «Lesson» section.

3
00:00:13.131 --> 00:00:17.500
In «Tasks» you find the tests your teacher gave you.

4
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.570
Press «Start» to begin.

5
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:33.018
Pick an option – your answer is saved automatically.

6
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:37.256
«My results» shows all your results.

7
00:00:37.256 --> 00:00:42.291
The «Result package»: your answers, the correct ones and explanations.

8
00:00:42.695 --> 00:00:48.247
If you get stuck, go back to the «Guide» – all videos are there.
